WEBVTT

00:11.011 --> 00:13.013
[rock music playing]

00:43.544 --> 00:45.254
[boss] Do you like jjajangmyeon that much?

00:45.337 --> 00:46.672
CHAPTER 36:
WHO THE HELL ARE YOU?

00:46.756 --> 00:48.466
-I remember how much you like it.
-Yes, boss.

00:48.549 --> 00:50.134
-Is it good?
-[chuckling]

00:55.181 --> 00:56.724
[Eui-ju gasps] Mr. Ga! [gasps]

00:56.807 --> 00:58.309
[whimpers] Are you okay?

00:58.392 --> 01:00.394
-[groans]
-Oh, no.

01:00.478 --> 01:01.479
Are you okay?

01:01.562 --> 01:03.606
[gasps] I'm sorry. Oh, my, Mr. Ga.

01:03.689 --> 01:05.357
Oh, my goodness, Mr. Ga.

01:05.441 --> 01:07.860
What are these beautiful
angels doing here?

01:07.943 --> 01:08.944
[thugs chuckling]

01:09.028 --> 01:12.615
What brings such a divine presence
to this humble place?

01:13.199 --> 01:16.660
Did you do that to our boy right there?

01:17.244 --> 01:19.705
-Yeah. [chuckles]
-[Eui-ju] Oh, my goodness, Mr. Ga.

01:19.789 --> 01:21.290
[boss chuckling] Well, now.

01:21.791 --> 01:23.501
Guess what, boys.

01:23.584 --> 01:25.461
We have guests in the house.

01:25.544 --> 01:28.214
Don't just sit back there.
Bring them some welcome drinks.

01:28.297 --> 01:29.298
Oh, man.

01:29.381 --> 01:30.633
Stay with the kids.

01:31.467 --> 01:32.551
Should we?

01:32.635 --> 01:34.845
-[boss chuckles]
-[Eui-ju whimpers]

01:34.929 --> 01:35.930
Good luck.

01:37.681 --> 01:38.724
Did they hit you?

01:41.519 --> 01:43.354
-Mr. Dong-ju--
-Nah, he's all right. Don't worry.

01:43.437 --> 01:44.897
He's going to be okay.

01:44.980 --> 01:46.649
Is this fun for you?

01:49.109 --> 01:50.319
Picking on kids?

01:51.028 --> 01:52.029
[sighs]

01:52.988 --> 01:54.490
-[Gi-jeon] Damn.
-[coughs]

01:56.909 --> 01:57.910
[sighs]

01:58.494 --> 02:01.247
-Oh, you little annoying bastards.
-Teach him a lesson.

02:01.956 --> 02:03.457
-[blow lands]
-[groans]

02:03.541 --> 02:05.543
-Holy--
-What? W-What the hell?

02:05.626 --> 02:06.627
Hey!

02:07.336 --> 02:09.004
[heroic rock music playing]

02:09.088 --> 02:10.464
[thug groans]

02:12.925 --> 02:13.884
Hey!

02:14.844 --> 02:15.970
[sighs]

02:17.888 --> 02:19.139
[thug] That crazy little…

02:19.223 --> 02:20.224
[grunts]

02:20.307 --> 02:21.308
Boys, let's get him!

02:22.518 --> 02:24.645
[grunting]

02:26.480 --> 02:27.481
[yelling]

02:29.191 --> 02:30.568
-Hey!
-[grunting]

02:30.651 --> 02:31.652
There you go!

02:33.320 --> 02:34.572
Damn it!

02:38.075 --> 02:39.076
That's right!

02:40.035 --> 02:41.620
What are you doing? [gasps]

02:41.704 --> 02:42.997
[grunts]

02:43.080 --> 02:45.416
Are you okay, man?
Yeah, yeah, you're okay.

02:58.846 --> 03:00.097
-[boss] Look at you.
-Hold on.

03:00.180 --> 03:03.183
[boss] Hey, hey, hey. Oh, man.
Can a teacher be this good at fighting?

03:03.267 --> 03:04.894
-[whimpers]
-Teacher…

03:08.063 --> 03:09.064
[boss grunts]

03:10.149 --> 03:11.442
[Eui-ju gasps]

03:12.318 --> 03:14.194
[groans] Damn.

03:14.278 --> 03:16.947
[groaning]

03:17.865 --> 03:19.199
[exclaims]

03:22.620 --> 03:26.624
[panting] Who the hell are you?

03:27.791 --> 03:29.793
Me? A literature teacher.

03:31.170 --> 03:34.006
Whoa, a literature teacher. Damn it!

03:34.882 --> 03:36.675
[shirt ripping]

03:40.512 --> 03:43.557
[dramatic techno music playing]

03:49.813 --> 03:50.981
[gasps]

03:54.610 --> 03:55.611
No, don't. Don't.

03:59.114 --> 04:00.950
[whispering] Here, let's go. Come on.

04:05.245 --> 04:07.581
EPISODE 12

04:07.665 --> 04:08.666
[music fades]

04:08.749 --> 04:10.167
How are you going to fix this?

04:10.793 --> 04:12.461
We'll pretend it never happened. [laughs]

04:13.379 --> 04:15.214
Apologize to the students.

04:17.549 --> 04:18.676
-We're sorry.
-We're sorry.

04:21.011 --> 04:22.346
Are you gonna show up again?

04:22.972 --> 04:24.056
-No, sir.
-No, sir.

04:24.640 --> 04:26.141
No, we won't.

04:26.809 --> 04:28.227
If I see your faces again,

04:29.061 --> 04:30.813
you'll be dead meat for real.

04:31.981 --> 04:32.982
[sighs]

04:33.065 --> 04:35.567
[boss] Oh, uh, a shaman once told me that

04:35.651 --> 04:38.153
I'd live a long life. [chuckles, sighs]

04:38.237 --> 04:39.738
[comical, awkward music playing]

04:39.822 --> 04:41.198
[groans]

04:43.283 --> 04:44.576
Goodbye then, Teach.

04:45.160 --> 04:47.871
Uh, I mean, Mr. Teacher, sir. [chuckles]

04:49.331 --> 04:50.457
[sighs] Let's go now.

04:52.960 --> 04:53.961
[Da-ju] Let's go.

05:01.010 --> 05:04.263
[groaning]

05:04.346 --> 05:05.681
Oh, fuck!

05:05.764 --> 05:07.766
What the hell's wrong with that guy?

05:08.392 --> 05:10.436
A literature teacher? Huh?

05:10.519 --> 05:12.062
Can a literature teacher do that?

05:13.147 --> 05:15.024
He was actually being serious

05:15.649 --> 05:18.485
when he said we'd be dead
if he saw our faces again.

05:20.237 --> 05:23.407
The look in his eyes.
I could tell he meant it when he said it.

05:23.991 --> 05:26.577
[Yeong-jae] What? Who are they?
What if they kidnapped her?

05:26.660 --> 05:29.371
[Dan-ji] What fancy people?
She lives at a shelter.

05:29.913 --> 05:32.166
-[operator] The number you dialed cannot…
-Why wouldn't she pick up?

05:32.249 --> 05:33.417
CHAPTER 37:
UNMASKED FOR JUSTICE

05:33.500 --> 05:35.127
Why is she not even checking her phone?

05:35.210 --> 05:37.713
[inhales sharply, sighs]

05:37.796 --> 05:39.465
[line ringing]

05:52.895 --> 05:54.354
Geez.

05:57.191 --> 05:59.234
[breathes shakily]

06:00.611 --> 06:03.530
[tender music playing]

06:13.874 --> 06:14.958
Darn you!

06:16.919 --> 06:18.170
Seriously?

06:18.962 --> 06:21.673
I was so worried about you. [whimpers]

06:22.466 --> 06:24.676
It was already scary
knowing Ji-a was in danger,

06:24.760 --> 06:26.178
but I couldn't reach you either.

06:26.261 --> 06:29.264
I wondered if you got involved in it,
or if something bad was happening.

06:29.348 --> 06:30.891
I got all kinds of ideas.

06:30.974 --> 06:33.227
[whimpers] Geez.

06:34.103 --> 06:36.855
You didn't answer my calls
or even check my texts.

06:38.982 --> 06:40.734
None of the girls knew
what you were up to.

06:40.818 --> 06:42.778
I was scared to death alone.
You know that?

06:43.779 --> 06:45.280
[sobbing]

06:46.615 --> 06:48.325
I have a crush on Math.

06:52.788 --> 06:54.248
[sniffles]

06:54.790 --> 06:55.791
Huh?

06:57.709 --> 07:01.463
I could've just told you
that I started to have a crush on Math,

07:02.422 --> 07:04.049
but I couldn't open up to you.

07:04.967 --> 07:08.554
I thought you'd find it stupid because
we used to bad-mouth him all the time,

07:08.637 --> 07:10.556
and I was feeling lost myself

07:11.306 --> 07:12.683
with all these emotions.

07:13.600 --> 07:16.687
And then, I just hurt your feelings.

07:17.729 --> 07:18.730
I'm sorry.

07:24.027 --> 07:27.281
What made me sad was knowing that
you were keeping a secret from me.

07:28.615 --> 07:30.826
I don't even care
if you have a crush on Dong-ju.

07:31.660 --> 07:34.788
But I was just upset because
you weren't opening up to me.

07:38.375 --> 07:41.003
You used to share
every little detail with me.

07:42.629 --> 07:45.632
Even when you were constipated,
I was the first to know.

07:51.889 --> 07:54.558
You come before anyone else to me.
You know that.

07:57.186 --> 07:58.187
[sniffles]

07:59.980 --> 08:00.981
So…

08:01.690 --> 08:06.069
If Mr. Dong-ju and I were both drowning,
who would you save first?

08:08.322 --> 08:10.866
You used to compete
in baby swimming contests.

08:13.744 --> 08:14.745
You're silly.

08:15.829 --> 08:16.830
[chuckles]

08:17.664 --> 08:19.583
Anyway, did something really happen?

08:23.128 --> 08:25.672
You're not gonna believe me
even if I tell you.

08:25.756 --> 08:26.882
What is it?

08:26.965 --> 08:27.966
Come on. Tell me.

08:29.259 --> 08:31.678
-At first, all those gangsters…
-[chuckles]

08:31.762 --> 08:34.223
-…totally looked down on him.
-Mm-hmm. Uh-huh.

08:34.306 --> 08:36.892
You know, they were kind of like,
"Who's this wimp?"

08:36.975 --> 08:37.976
And then?

08:38.060 --> 08:41.730
But then, he just looked at them ice-cold.

08:41.813 --> 08:44.358
His voice wasn't that gentle voice
he usually uses with us.

08:44.441 --> 08:46.568
-Mm-hmm. [giggles]
-He looked at them and said,

08:47.819 --> 08:49.821
"Is it fun picking on kids?"

08:49.905 --> 08:51.198
[gasps] Oh, man.

08:51.281 --> 08:53.825
I got goose bumps all over, all over!

08:53.909 --> 08:55.577
Then he just started beating them up

08:55.661 --> 08:58.372
with a front kick, and a back kick
and a flying kick!

08:58.455 --> 09:00.666
He grabbed them by the collar
and threw punches like…

09:00.749 --> 09:02.376
like a movie. Bam! Bam!

09:02.459 --> 09:04.795
He beat every one of them.
There wasn't even one standing.

09:04.878 --> 09:06.463
-And then…
-Uh-huh?

09:06.546 --> 09:09.258
And then… his shirt got ripped.

09:09.341 --> 09:10.342
It got ripped?

09:10.425 --> 09:12.970
[gasps] You know the Medusa, right?

09:13.053 --> 09:15.639
It was right there
with all the snakes coiled up.

09:15.722 --> 09:18.225
The whole image, the whole thing.
You know what I'm saying?

09:18.308 --> 09:21.353
[gasps] And there's also this massive
dragon-like creature all the way across.

09:21.436 --> 09:22.688
It was huge!

09:23.272 --> 09:24.273
Dong-ju…

09:25.315 --> 09:26.316
uh…

09:26.984 --> 09:29.111
has a tattoo? [gasps]

09:29.194 --> 09:30.195
Yeah.

09:30.737 --> 09:33.615
And also, it looked pretty old
with the ink a bit faded,

09:34.241 --> 09:36.118
but it was definitely Medusa.

09:36.868 --> 09:41.748
Uh, and it seemed like it stretched
all the way from the shoulder to the back,

09:41.832 --> 09:43.292
but I didn't get to see his back.

09:43.792 --> 09:47.004
Huh. Then Dong-ju's…

09:47.087 --> 09:48.255
[inhales sharply]

09:48.880 --> 09:52.509
I think maybe…
I think that he used to be a gangster.

09:57.139 --> 09:59.516
[amusing music playing]

10:02.519 --> 10:03.770
A-Are you okay?

10:07.357 --> 10:10.944
You're saying
Dong-ju used to be a gangster?

10:20.120 --> 10:21.830
[softly] I shouldn't have told her.

10:22.622 --> 10:25.208
-[Woo-su groans] Wait, wait!
-[Gi-jeon] I didn't even touch you yet.

10:25.709 --> 10:27.169
Wait, wait, wait, wait! Just wait.

10:27.252 --> 10:29.004
-Brace yourself.
-[groaning]

10:29.087 --> 10:30.464
-Hold still.
-Put some on his lips too.

10:30.547 --> 10:31.631
-Hold still.
-[Woo-su whining]

10:31.715 --> 10:33.967
-I'm almost done.
-Stop, stop. It hurts. [groans]

10:34.051 --> 10:35.469
-I'll put a bandage on later.
-It hurts.

10:35.552 --> 10:38.263
This is ridiculous. Ugh.
He's driving me insane, seriously.

10:38.347 --> 10:39.639
Let me see your hands.

10:39.723 --> 10:41.725
Geez. Your hands are a total mess.

10:43.643 --> 10:46.271
-This part is okay at least.
-[Dong-ju sighs]

10:49.733 --> 10:50.734
[groans]

10:50.817 --> 10:51.902
[Gi-jeon] Are you all right?

10:54.404 --> 10:56.531
I was never going to
get into a fight again.

10:59.493 --> 11:00.786
But this happened.

11:02.120 --> 11:03.372
[sighs]

11:03.455 --> 11:05.040
And in front of my students too.

11:05.123 --> 11:06.166
[inhales sharply]

11:06.249 --> 11:07.834
-[sighs]
-It was inevitable though.

11:09.503 --> 11:10.796
They even saw my tattoo.

11:13.715 --> 11:16.176
[groans] What do I do now?

11:17.719 --> 11:18.720
[sighs]

11:21.098 --> 11:22.182
[sighs]

11:29.898 --> 11:31.066
Remember?

11:33.693 --> 11:35.195
In 11th grade,

11:35.278 --> 11:38.865
when you had that motorcycle accident,
and I took you to the hospital.

11:39.449 --> 11:40.575
When you woke up you asked,

11:40.659 --> 11:42.744
"Was it you?" And threw a punch at me.

11:42.828 --> 11:44.996
-[chuckles] Geez.
-[Woo-su chuckles]

11:45.580 --> 11:47.666
I thought you were the one
who rammed into me.

11:47.749 --> 11:49.000
[chuckles]

11:49.084 --> 11:50.794
You brought me that porridge
back then, remember?

11:51.878 --> 11:53.171
It was so weird though.

11:53.964 --> 11:57.634
Why would this guy buy me this stuff,
even after I hit him for nothing?

11:57.717 --> 11:59.428
[Gi-jeon] It was mid-winter.

11:59.511 --> 12:01.596
And you were only wearing slippers.

12:01.680 --> 12:03.432
And you looked younger than me.

12:03.515 --> 12:06.017
I just assumed you were struggling.
That's why.

12:07.811 --> 12:11.064
It was the first time anyone had ever
been kind to me for nothing.

12:11.773 --> 12:13.108
It made me feel weird.

12:15.444 --> 12:19.406
I thought I'll end up being a real jerk
if I keep living like this.

12:19.906 --> 12:22.242
Will I ever be able to be
someone like him?

12:25.078 --> 12:28.832
If I hadn't met you back then,
I'd probably be living the same life.

12:29.416 --> 12:31.751
[tender music playing]

12:32.878 --> 12:34.087
[Gi-jeon] Back then,

12:35.130 --> 12:37.048
I just thought you were crazy.

12:38.425 --> 12:40.010
[inhales sharply]

12:40.093 --> 12:41.970
But somehow, I knew I'd see you again.

12:42.637 --> 12:43.638
[stammers] How?

12:43.722 --> 12:44.723
I don't know.

12:47.142 --> 12:48.310
A hunch.

12:50.812 --> 12:52.606
Then I saw this egghead

12:53.106 --> 12:55.817
-during our teacher training orientation.
-[chuckles]

12:55.901 --> 12:58.862
I was so glad to see you.
Weren't you glad as well?

13:01.364 --> 13:04.326
More or less.
He had a pretty dumb look on his face.

13:04.409 --> 13:05.994
-Oh, come on.
-You got that right.

13:06.661 --> 13:08.788
-You're right. He still does.
-[Gi-jeon] Whatever.

13:08.872 --> 13:09.956
Well…

13:10.749 --> 13:13.418
Past or present, it doesn't really matter

13:14.336 --> 13:16.713
which version of you it is,
you're still you.

13:18.798 --> 13:20.467
You just have to live with it.

13:24.971 --> 13:27.516
I must say, Dong-ju is really something.

13:28.141 --> 13:30.143
A street fighter turned over a new leaf

13:30.227 --> 13:33.146
and studied to join our
college of education in two years?

13:33.230 --> 13:34.606
-That's nearly impossible.
-Ridiculous.

13:34.689 --> 13:37.442
-Mmm.
-He was more than capable, but…

13:38.235 --> 13:40.403
the circumstances just didn't favor him.

13:40.987 --> 13:43.615
And where was that? Remember?

13:43.698 --> 13:45.659
When Dong-ju showed his real skills?

13:45.742 --> 13:48.119
-When… When was that?
-The store.

13:48.203 --> 13:49.246
-That's right!
-[chuckles]

13:49.329 --> 13:51.289
It was the first time since
the convenience store, right?

13:51.373 --> 13:52.415
-[chuckles]
-[Dong-ju] Come on.

13:52.499 --> 13:54.376
-I told you not to bring that up.
-[Da-ju] The convenience store.

13:54.459 --> 13:57.671
We were all wasted, walking toward
the convenience store like zombies

13:57.754 --> 13:58.880
to get a cup of noodles.

13:58.964 --> 14:02.259
When those thugs started picking on
that girl that was working there.

14:06.763 --> 14:08.765
[keyboard clacking]

14:13.520 --> 14:15.105
Is this fun for you?

14:16.398 --> 14:17.399
Picking on kids?

14:17.482 --> 14:19.401
-[gasps]
-[grunting]

14:19.484 --> 14:20.944
[intense heroic music playing]

14:21.027 --> 14:23.488
Me? A literature teacher.

14:23.572 --> 14:24.739
[music fades]

14:24.823 --> 14:27.367
[gasps, sighs]

14:28.535 --> 14:31.371
I had no idea
Mr. Yoon could have a secret like that.

14:32.247 --> 14:34.833
He usually hides his true self, but…

14:34.916 --> 14:38.295
But if he has to protect someone,
he fights.

14:39.296 --> 14:41.548
[sighing]

14:41.631 --> 14:44.718
It's coming. It's coming.
I'm feeling inspired.

14:45.635 --> 14:46.803
[tense Western music playing]

14:46.886 --> 14:50.181
WE WERE FRIENDS, EPISODE 8

14:58.189 --> 15:00.400
Forget it. So, where is that place?

15:00.483 --> 15:02.027
Their food is so good and creamy.

15:04.946 --> 15:06.781
[rewinding sounds]

15:09.159 --> 15:10.243
Let's go.

15:14.873 --> 15:15.957
Who the hell are you?

15:17.584 --> 15:19.961
Fists aren't meant for hurting people.

15:20.045 --> 15:23.381
They're meant for protecting them.
Haven't you learned?

15:23.465 --> 15:26.384
Damn! So we're playing teacher, are we?

15:28.595 --> 15:30.930
-You little--
-[grunting]

15:31.014 --> 15:32.641
[blows landing]

15:32.724 --> 15:34.184
[shrieks]

15:40.857 --> 15:42.192
[thugs coughing]

15:42.275 --> 15:43.568
If I see your faces again,

15:44.569 --> 15:46.154
you're dead meat for real.

15:48.490 --> 15:50.867
Come on. Let's go. Let's go now. Come on.

15:50.950 --> 15:52.285
[grunting]

15:53.203 --> 15:54.287
I was gonna help you,

15:54.371 --> 15:56.331
but it seemed like
you were handling it just fine.

16:00.168 --> 16:01.795
"If I see your faces again,

16:02.712 --> 16:04.756
you're dead meat for real."

16:06.675 --> 16:07.676
[sighs]

16:08.176 --> 16:09.260
Oh, man.

16:10.095 --> 16:13.306
He's so cool. So cool.

16:13.390 --> 16:14.391
[chuckles]

16:14.974 --> 16:16.559
[clicks tongue, sighs]

16:16.643 --> 16:20.522
CHAPTER 38:
SIR! I HAVE SOMETHING TO SAY!

16:20.605 --> 16:22.107
[students chattering]

16:32.909 --> 16:33.910
Hi.

16:45.547 --> 16:46.673
What's gotten into her?

16:46.756 --> 16:47.757
Beats me.

16:48.425 --> 16:50.385
-She's scaring me.
-[chuckles]

16:57.642 --> 17:00.145
[class] Hello.

17:00.228 --> 17:02.981
-Mr. Ga, your face.
-What happened?

17:03.064 --> 17:04.816
-Mr. Ga, are you okay?
-Did you fight?

17:04.899 --> 17:06.025
What's going on?

17:06.109 --> 17:09.195
-Are you okay?
-Come on, Mr. Ga, tell us what happened.

17:09.279 --> 17:11.906
Mr. Ga! Mr. Ga, did you get into a fight?

17:11.990 --> 17:13.450
-Tell us.
-[banging on podium]

17:13.533 --> 17:14.617
Quiet.

17:14.701 --> 17:15.744
I'm okay, so don't worry.

17:15.827 --> 17:17.245
-Aw. Really?
-You don't look okay.

17:17.328 --> 17:19.706
-It's time for attendance.
-[clamoring continues]

17:19.789 --> 17:21.374
-Jeon Ji-min.
-Here.

17:21.458 --> 17:22.584
-Oh Ji-ho.
-Here.

17:22.667 --> 17:24.836
-It's worse than I thought it'd be.
-[Woo-su] Kim Ga-yeong.

17:24.919 --> 17:26.796
-[Ga-yeong] Here.
-It looks better than yesterday.

17:26.880 --> 17:29.674
-Oh, you guys…
-[Woo-su] Hong Su-min.

17:29.758 --> 17:30.800
You're friends again?

17:30.884 --> 17:32.510
-[Woo-su] Jeon Chae-won.
-[chuckles softly]

17:32.594 --> 17:33.928
-Well, when weren't we?
-Im Su-yeon.

17:34.012 --> 17:35.722
-Here.
-[chuckles softly]

17:37.348 --> 17:39.142
-Lee Eun-ji.
-Here.

17:39.225 --> 17:40.602
-Choi Hye-jeong.
-Here.

17:42.937 --> 17:45.023
Good luck with your class today. Bye.

17:45.648 --> 17:47.525
[class] Thank you.

17:47.609 --> 17:49.444
[chattering]

17:49.527 --> 17:50.904
Why is he always like that?

17:52.989 --> 17:53.990
Mr. Ga!

17:59.996 --> 18:02.248
I'm sorry. Because of me, you…

18:05.627 --> 18:06.628
Are you okay?

18:08.505 --> 18:09.506
Yes.

18:11.174 --> 18:13.176
That's good. Pay attention in class.

18:15.178 --> 18:16.805
[gentle music playing]

18:16.888 --> 18:17.889
Okay.

18:32.821 --> 18:33.822
Hmm?

18:35.240 --> 18:36.324
Hello.

18:36.407 --> 18:37.408
-Hi.
-Hello.

18:45.959 --> 18:47.544
[music fades]

18:47.627 --> 18:49.128
Are you okay?

18:50.255 --> 18:52.841
I am. I just have to reconsider.

18:56.135 --> 18:59.347
But look… [stammering]
…he's seriously different now.

18:59.430 --> 19:00.598
I mean that.

19:00.682 --> 19:03.810
I really think Mr. Yoon is
a good man now, actually.

19:04.978 --> 19:07.230
Never mind. My opinion doesn't matter.

19:07.897 --> 19:10.233
Your feelings are more important. [sighs]

19:10.733 --> 19:13.111
If you're over him,
that's perfectly fine too.

19:13.736 --> 19:14.737
I understand.

19:16.406 --> 19:17.907
Who said I was over him?

19:20.118 --> 19:21.119
Isn't that what you meant?

19:22.996 --> 19:24.998
No. It's my turn now.

19:25.999 --> 19:27.709
From here on out, it's on me.

19:27.792 --> 19:30.879
No matter what hits us,
I'll keep Dong-ju safe.

19:31.421 --> 19:32.422
And out of trouble.

19:32.505 --> 19:34.507
[cheerful music playing]

19:34.591 --> 19:35.592
Go-ya.

19:36.342 --> 19:38.595
To do that,
I need to get into a good college.

19:38.678 --> 19:40.346
And build a successful life.

19:40.430 --> 19:42.765
I need to be someone
Dong-ju can truly rely on.

19:44.350 --> 19:48.271
Actually, if I'm going to protect Dong-ju,
I'm going to have to step it up.

19:50.273 --> 19:51.482
The CSAT.

19:52.025 --> 19:55.361
I have to get a good CSAT score
so I'll have more college options.

19:55.445 --> 19:56.446
[sighs]

19:57.196 --> 19:58.197
You know what?

19:58.907 --> 20:00.950
This must be why
I've been single since birth.

20:01.618 --> 20:02.619
Hmm?

20:02.702 --> 20:04.913
All I want is for that person…

20:05.496 --> 20:09.292
I mean, I just want my crush to
like me back, that's all I want.

20:09.375 --> 20:11.711
I want him to fall for me
and be head over heels for me

20:11.794 --> 20:13.796
even if I don't do anything in particular.

20:15.173 --> 20:16.174
[sighs]

20:16.758 --> 20:19.844
But all I do is whine like a child

20:20.845 --> 20:22.180
and get jealous too,

20:22.764 --> 20:25.099
instead of trying to become
someone attractive first.

20:30.146 --> 20:32.482
You're already gorgeous, okay?

20:32.565 --> 20:35.151
[upbeat K-pop song playing]

20:35.234 --> 20:36.235
Okay?

20:37.862 --> 20:40.156
[inhales deeply, sighs]

20:40.239 --> 20:41.699
What do you think I should do?

20:43.660 --> 20:46.120
-[sighs]
-[sighs]

20:48.373 --> 20:49.374
Just tell him.

20:51.876 --> 20:53.586
He might leave for the States.

20:55.004 --> 20:56.464
-Tell him?
-Mm-hmm.

20:58.132 --> 21:02.053
[sighs] I don't know. How do you do that?

21:04.055 --> 21:05.807
Okay. Look into his eyes.

21:05.890 --> 21:07.350
To show you mean it.

21:07.433 --> 21:09.102
You have to make eye contact

21:09.769 --> 21:11.688
and stare right at him…

21:11.771 --> 21:13.106
[amusing music playing]

21:13.189 --> 21:15.024
…for three seconds.

21:17.777 --> 21:18.903
Ow.

21:19.612 --> 21:21.197
-[groans] Oh, come on.
-[chuckles]

21:21.280 --> 21:23.199
How am I supposed to do that?

21:23.282 --> 21:24.784
Do you want to tell him
how you feel or not?

21:24.867 --> 21:26.786
[sighs, sniffles]

21:27.537 --> 21:28.871
I do want to.

21:28.955 --> 21:30.915
Then listen to me. Three seconds.

21:33.751 --> 21:35.169
Okay, I'll give it a try.

21:35.253 --> 21:37.880
Look into his eyes for three seconds
and say, "I like you."

21:37.964 --> 21:39.507
That's all you need to do.

21:42.427 --> 21:44.512
Even if it's someone you have
zero feelings for,

21:44.595 --> 21:46.681
do you know what happens
when you hear that?

21:47.598 --> 21:50.685
It makes you waver.
Well, it really shakes you.

21:51.269 --> 21:52.729
-Waver?
-Mm-hmm.

21:52.812 --> 21:54.480
He'll waver. For sure.

21:54.564 --> 21:55.982
That's the way it is for men.

21:57.483 --> 22:00.778
First snow, remember?
Always goes straight ahead.

22:02.447 --> 22:04.449
Okay. Straight ahead.

22:04.532 --> 22:06.117
Don't waste your time
waiting and hesitating.

22:06.200 --> 22:07.452
Take no detours, okay?

22:08.202 --> 22:11.164
Okay.
Then where do you think I should do it?

22:11.247 --> 22:13.082
You have an after-school class today.
After that!

22:14.333 --> 22:15.334
Today?

22:16.544 --> 22:18.004
Today… [inhales sharply]

22:19.297 --> 22:22.008
MURIM GIRLS' HIGH SCHOOL

22:22.675 --> 22:25.178
So, the function graph
would be organized like this, right?

22:25.803 --> 22:27.597
-What should I say first?
-The x-coordinates of

22:27.680 --> 22:29.640
the intersections between y equals f(x)

22:29.724 --> 22:32.310
-and y equals k to have one positive…
-Mr. Ga, I…

22:32.393 --> 22:34.979
…and two negative values, the range for k

22:35.063 --> 22:37.648
-must be between minus eight to zero.
-The truth is, I have…

22:37.732 --> 22:40.651
Once you plot it,
it becomes intuitively clear, okay?

22:40.735 --> 22:42.653
-Let's stop here today. Good job.
-[whimpers]

22:42.737 --> 22:43.738
[class] Thank you.

22:43.821 --> 22:45.281
Huh? What the…

22:45.364 --> 22:46.449
It's over already?

22:46.532 --> 22:47.533
[student] Good-bye.

22:48.951 --> 22:50.244
[groans, inhales shakily]

22:51.370 --> 22:54.415
Okay, let's wait until
all the girls leave first.

22:56.876 --> 22:58.753
[groans, breathes shakily]

23:01.422 --> 23:02.298
You leaving?

23:04.300 --> 23:06.010
I am. I'm leaving.

23:06.094 --> 23:07.095
Mr. Ga!

23:08.971 --> 23:10.098
[hopeful music playing]

23:10.181 --> 23:12.433
[breathing shakily]
Now is the time. It has to be now.

23:19.315 --> 23:20.399
You got…

23:23.069 --> 23:25.780
your new glasses. [chuckles]

23:25.863 --> 23:28.950
[inhales deeply, shudders] Oh, no. No.

23:32.495 --> 23:34.580
[comical music playing]

23:36.040 --> 23:37.291
[groans]

23:38.376 --> 23:39.418
[sighs]

23:40.002 --> 23:41.462
Come on. You can do it, Eui-ju!

23:41.546 --> 23:42.630
Wait!

23:44.674 --> 23:46.843
[whimpering]

23:48.761 --> 23:50.138
No, it has to be today.

23:50.221 --> 23:51.931
Either I do it today
or I'm never gonna do it.

24:03.651 --> 24:05.945
Mr. Ga! Mr. Ga. Wait, Mr. Ga.

24:06.571 --> 24:09.407
Sir, I have something to tell you!
Wait just a moment.

24:09.490 --> 24:11.784
Wait, Mr. Ga. [panting] Hold on.

24:11.868 --> 24:13.494
[panting]

24:15.788 --> 24:16.998
[pants] Just a second.

24:22.962 --> 24:24.005
What is it, huh?

24:25.006 --> 24:26.007
I…

24:31.554 --> 24:32.722
I…

24:32.805 --> 24:34.807
[hopeful, tender music playing]

24:40.980 --> 24:41.981
I…

25:06.339 --> 25:07.840
Yeo Eui-ju, follow me.

25:07.924 --> 25:08.925
Why is Math so strict?

25:09.008 --> 25:12.178
[Eui-ju] He's just doing it his way,
isn't he? That might actually be fair.

25:12.261 --> 25:14.013
[Ha-su] There's this web novel
with characters

25:14.096 --> 25:16.641
who are almost identical to
our Korean lit, Math, PE,

25:16.724 --> 25:18.184
and Japanese language teachers.

25:18.267 --> 25:20.102
[groans]
I'm dying to know who the writer is.

25:20.186 --> 25:21.520
You're done for.

25:21.604 --> 25:23.022
I think you should know who it is.

25:23.105 --> 25:25.191
-It's Yeo Eui-ju.
-What are you talking about?

25:25.274 --> 25:27.109
-[Go-ya] Is it you?
-Actually…

25:27.193 --> 25:28.736
-Go-ya, what happened is--
-This is nuts.

25:28.819 --> 25:30.363
[Young-hee] You'll be expelled.

25:30.446 --> 25:32.281
[Eui-ju]
Just act like you don't know, okay?

25:32.365 --> 25:34.367
I don't want you getting in trouble
because of me.

25:34.450 --> 25:37.286
Hello, everyone. This is Imuk.
